ksystemstats: also report removable MMC/SD drives in System Monitor

System Monitor showed 0B/0B for the disk because plugins/disks/disks.cpp
only accepted drives of type HardDisk; the SD card the root lives on is
SdMmc, so no volume sensor was created at all and the `disk/all/*`
aggregate sensors stayed at zero.

--- a/plugins/disks/disks.cpp
+++ b/plugins/disks/disks.cpp
@@ -186,1 +186,1 @@
-            if (type == Solid::StorageDrive::HardDisk) {
+            if (type == Solid::StorageDrive::HardDisk || type == Solid::StorageDrive::SdMmc) {
